      "writtenOn": "2023-08-02T23:43:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought StartAction() FinishAction() Flush() are called from status.go, and status.go has a lock for them. https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/ui/status/status.go;l\u003d283?q\u003d%22FinishAction%22%20s.lock\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main\n\nWe\u0027d better add a lock for critical_path_logger? or is it okay to rely on status.go?",
